#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
NLM Brain Control Interface

Advanced command-line interface for power users and researchers to control
the NLM artificial brain and analyze its behavior.

Usage:
    nlmctl <command> [options]

Commands:
    status          Show current brain status and metrics
    checkpoint      Save/load brain checkpoints
    config          Show/modify configuration
    memory          Inspect memory systems
    neuromod        Control neuromodulators
    develop         Trigger development stages
    test            Run specific integration tests
    help            Show this help message

Environment:
    NLM_HOME       Path to NLM installation (default: current directory)
    NLM_LOG_LEVEL  Logging level (debug, info, warning, error)

For advanced usage, see the NLM documentation at:
    https://nlm.readthedocs.io
"""

